; Gandalf cheers the player on
;
; Script handler (op 3, in Gandalf's script #R$C8D4). Says one of "You are doing
; a great job", "Hurry up" or "Hello", chosen by a random number from 0 to 2.
; Always passes the test pass of the script engine (#R$9D44).
; .
; Hardware: none (the text goes through the message printer).
@label=GandalfCheers
c$A4FE CALL $9D44
 $A501 LD A,$02
 $A503 CALL $9C9F    ; random 0 to 2
 $A506 LD HL,$B052   ; "You are doing a great job"
 $A509 CP $00
 $A50B JP Z,$A1E3
 $A50E LD HL,$B05B   ; "Hurry up"
 $A511 CP $01
 $A513 JP Z,$A1E3
 $A516 LD HL,$B05F   ; "Hello"
 $A519 JP $A1E3
